{"id": 71, "ts": 1780126034.099966, "event": "public_discussion_message", "round": 4, "agent": "agent_3", "message": "I remain convinced that Candidate\u202fB is the strongest overall fit.\u202fHis very conscientious nature and proven ability to handle stress directly address operational reliability and stress\u2011resilience \u2013 the two most safety\u2011critical criteria for long\u2011distance flights.\u202fHis solid technical skills \u2013 especially accurate weather assessment and excellent computer proficiency \u2013 give him the cognitive competence needed for complex international routes.\u202fWhile I acknowledge the concern that he can appear pretentious and occasionally adopts the wrong tone, these communication issues are less severe than the interpersonal deficits seen in the other candidates: Candidate\u202fA\u2019s unfriendly demeanor and unhealthy habits, Candidate\u202fC\u2019s egocentric attitude and reluctance to further his education, and Candidate\u202fD\u2019s moodiness and loner reputation.\u202fGiven that B\u2019s strengths in reliability, stress management, and technical competence outweigh his relatively modest communication short\u2011comings, I continue to recommend hiring Candidate\u202fB."}
